# Claude Code's local session state — accumulates real secrets over time
# (admin JWTs, cron secrets, etc. get auto-allowlisted into permissions
# as literal command strings) and was never protected by any gitignore
# before, since it sits at the repo root while every existing .gitignore
# is scoped to client/, server/ or e2e/. Never commit this.
.claude/

node_modules/

# Scratch/output artifacts dropped at the repo root during ad-hoc work
# (e.g. a one-off article export) — not part of the app.
.artifacts/

server/server.log
